<div class="container prose">
  <p>Kitchen disposals take a beating in Houston homes: hard water scale, fibrous leftovers, and occasional silverware slips can shut them down fast. If your unit hums without spinning, leaks under the sink, or trips the reset button repeatedly, it’s time for a professional look.</p>
  <h2>What we diagnose</h2>
  <ul>
    <li> Jammed impellers and foreign objects</li>
    <li> Worn seals and flange leaks</li>
    <li> Motor failure or electrical issues</li>
    <li> Incorrect sizing for your household</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Repair vs. replace</h2>
  <p>We’ll give you an honest recommendation. Minor issues often warrant repair; older, corroded units may be cheaper to replace than to keep patching.</p>
